#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/clusters.rst:32
msgid ""
"Provisions by default a Morpheus controlled Docker Cluster with 1 host. "
"Additional hosts can be added. Custom layouts can be created. Existing "
"Morpheus Docker Hosts are automatically converted to Clusters upon 4.0.0 "
"upgrade."
msgstr ""
"Aprovisiona por defecto un Morpheus controlled Docker Clúster con 1 host."
" Adicional hosts se puede agregar. Personalizado layouts se puede crear. "
"Existente Morpheus Docker Hosts son automáticamente converted a Clústeres"
" upon 4.0.0 actualización."

