#~ msgid "Hardware Passthrough"
#~ msgstr "Hardware Passthrough"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "|morpheus| includes hardware passthrough and"
#~ " pooling support for VMs provisioned "
#~ "to |clusters|. This support extends to"
#~ " GPU, USB and NVME devices. In "
#~ "order to be usable, such devices "
#~ "must be attached to a |host| or"
#~ " to multiple |hosts|. |morpheus| includes"
#~ " controls to detach hardware devices "
#~ "from the underlying OS on the "
#~ "hypervisor host and add them to a"
#~ " pool where they are available for"
#~ " consumption by VMs. GPU hardware can"
#~ " be attached to VMs at provision "
#~ "time through custom Service Plans or "
#~ "on an ad-hoc basis by manually "
#~ "attaching hardware to existing VMs. "
#~ "Other supported hardware types must be"
#~ " past through to the VM after "
#~ "provisioning."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "|morpheus| incluye hardware passthrough y "
#~ "pooling support para VMs aprovisionado a"
#~ " |clusters|. Este support extends a "
#~ "GPU, USB y NVME devices. Para be"
#~ " usable, such devices debe be adjunto"
#~ " un un |host| o a múltiples "
#~ "|hosts|. |morpheus| incluye controls a "
#~ "detach hardware devices desde el "
#~ "underlying OS en el hypervisor host "
#~ "y agregar them a un pool donde "
#~ "they están disponibles para consumption "
#~ "por VMs. GPU hardware puede be "
#~ "adjunto un VMs en provision tiempo "
#~ "a través de personalizado Servicio Plans"
#~ " o en un ad-hoc basis por "
#~ "manualmente attaching hardware a existente "
#~ "VMs. Otro soportado hardware tipos debe"
#~ " be past a través de al VM "
#~ "después de provisioning."

#~ msgid "Creating Service Plans"
#~ msgstr "Creating Service Plans"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When utilizing GPU hardware, it may "
#~ "be most convenient to use a custom"
#~ " Service Plan. This allows administrators"
#~ " to pre-configure the number of "
#~ "discrete hardware cards to attach to "
#~ "the VM at provision time. Once "
#~ "provisioned, the specified number of "
#~ "GPUs will be attached to the VM."
#~ " For workloads which are provisioned "
#~ "and torn down regularly, this will "
#~ "save additional steps of manually "
#~ "attaching GPUs available from the pool."
#~ " On teardown, attached devices of all"
#~ " types are released back to the "
#~ "pool. Though in some cases utilizing "
#~ "Service Plans may be most convenient,"
#~ " as you'll see in the next "
#~ "sections it is not strictly required."
#~ " It is also possible to manually "
#~ "attach GPUs or other hardware types "
#~ "on any existing VM runnning on "
#~ "|clusters|."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cuando utilizing GPU hardware, it puede"
#~ " be más convenient a usar un "
#~ "personalizado Servicio Plan. Este permite "
#~ "administrators a pre-configure el número"
#~ " de discrete hardware cards a attach"
#~ " al VM en provision tiempo. Once "
#~ "aprovisionado, el specified número de "
#~ "GPUs será be adjunto un el VM. "
#~ "Para cargas de trabajo cual son "
#~ "aprovisionado y torn down regularly, "
#~ "este será guardar adicional pasos de "
#~ "manualmente attaching GPUs disponible desde"
#~ " el pool. En teardown, attached "
#~ "devices de todos tipos son released "
#~ "back al pool. Though en algunos "
#~ "cases utilizing Servicio Plans puede be"
#~ " más convenient, como you'll ver en"
#~ " el siguiente sections it es no "
#~ "strictly requerido. It es también "
#~ "possible a manualmente attach GPUs o "
#~ "otro hardware tipos en cualquier "
#~ "existente VM runnning en |clusters|."

